# Paths Dodona leaves out when syncing this repository to the judge's files
# directory, which is copied into the sandbox for every submission. `run`
# executes `python -m tested`, and everything TESTed reads at judging time
# (language templates, linter configs, translations) lives under tested/.
# tests/ is only used by the judge's own CI and local development.
# Patterns are rsync exclude patterns, anchored to the repository root.
# See https://github.com/dodona-edu/dodona/issues/8763

/tests/
/devel/
/.devcontainer/
/.github/
/.editorconfig
/.gitignore
/CITATION.cff
/pyproject.toml
/requirements-test.txt
/requirements-dev.txt
/README.md
/tested/manual_example.py
